        "sha256": "1796d0b8e475df0493c9abbb7e1d11943b63bda04c2e11aeab5b0e4dbbcf78c8",
        "signing_date": "1977-02-02",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_11969.txt",
        "text_sha256": "23851224eec9b45ac4135cdb4d8c7d27531dc50ac6314c4ecb78f7fe8c72f7be",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1977-02-04/pdf/FR-1977-02-04.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. There is hereby delegated to the Chairman of the Federal Power \nCommission, hereafter the Chairman, all of the authority vested in the President \nby the Emergency Natural Gas Act of 1977, except for the authority to declare and \nterminate a natural gas emergency pursuant to Section 3 of said Act. Nothing in such \ndelegation shall be construed as delegating such authority to the Federal Power Com­\nmission as a collective body, except insofar as the Chairman may further delegate his \nauthority under Section 3 of this Order."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1800,
      "char_start": 1486,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:11969#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 15,
      "scope_id": "EO:11969#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "42 FR 6791, PDF pages 15-15",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "1796d0b8e475df0493c9abbb7e1d11943b63bda04c2e11aeab5b0e4dbbcf78c8",
        "signing_date": "1977-02-02",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_11969.txt",
        "text_sha256": "23851224eec9b45ac4135cdb4d8c7d27531dc50ac6314c4ecb78f7fe8c72f7be",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1977-02-04/pdf/FR-1977-02-04.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. The Chairman shall, to the extent he deems appropriate, consult with \nthe Secretary of the Interior, the Administrator of the Federal Energy Administration, \nother members of the Federal Power.Commission and the heads of other Executive \nagencies in exercising the authority delegated to him by this Order."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1998,
      "char_start": 1801,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:11969#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 15,
      "scope_id": "EO:11969#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "42 FR 6791, PDF pages 15-15",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "1796d0b8e475df0493c9abbb7e1d11943b63bda04c2e11aeab5b0e4dbbcf78c8",
        "signing_date": "1977-02-02",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_11969.txt",
        "text_sha256": "23851224eec9b45ac4135cdb4d8c7d27531dc50ac6314c4ecb78f7fe8c72f7be",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1977-02-04/pdf/FR-1977-02-04.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. All authority delegated to the Chairman by this Order may be further dele­\ngated, in whole or in part, by the Chairman to any other officer of the United \nStates or to any Executive agency."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2150,
      "char_start": 1999,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:11969#sec4",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 4.",
