        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1977-02-04/pdf/FR-1977-02-04.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 5. All Executive agencies shall, to the extent permitted by law, provide the \nChairman on request such administrative support and information as may be neces­\nsary to carry out the authority delegated to him by this Order."
    }
